# {{ mod_name }}

An event-driven Galaxy on Fire 2 PC mod by {{ author_name }}.

## Install

1. Install KaamoClubModApi in the Galaxy on Fire 2 game directory.
2. Generate this project into a folder named `{{ mod_id | snake_case }}`.
3. Copy that folder to `<Galaxy on Fire 2>/mods/{{ mod_id | snake_case }}/`.
4. Start the game and inspect the ModAPI console output.

`init.lua` demonstrates one-time initialization plus asteroid and station
events. Add only event names supported by the installed ModAPI version.

The generated Lua source is licensed under GPL-3.0-only. Klonker generated
these files but does not install, run, update, or manage the mod afterward.
